ELEMENTS
C          H         O          N          HE
END
SPECIES
O         H          OH         H2         O2            H2O        HO2
H2O2      CO         CO2        HCO        CH2O          CH3O       CH2CO            
HCCO      CH2OH      CH3OH      CH3        CH4           C2H2       C2H3              
C2H4      C2H5       C3H4       C3H5       C3H6          C3H7       C5H11CO
C10H22    C10H21     C10H21OO   C10H20OOH  OOC10H20OOH   C10ket     C10H20
MD5D      MD5DJ      MD5DJO2    MD5DOOHJ   O2MD5DOOH     MD5Dket    C6H11CHO
MD        MDJ        MDJO2      MDOOHJ     O2MDOOH       MDket      C6H13CHO
MP2D      MP2DMJ     MP3J       C2H3CO     CH3OCO        MD2D 
N         N2O        NO         NO2        N2            HE
END
REACTIONS

!n-c10h22 sub-mechanism

C10H22    +O2       = C10H21  +HO2                2.000E+15  0.00  50150.0  
C10H22    +OH       = C10H21  +H2O                3.000E+07  1.85     58.5
C10H22    +H        =>C10H21  +H2                 2.000E+08  2.00   2500.0
C10H22    +HO2      = C10H21  +H2O2               2.120E+14  0.00  17690.0
C10H21    +O2       = C10H21OO                    2.000E+11  0.00      0.0             
C10H21OO            = C10H20OOH                   5.510E+13  0.00  19000.0
C10H20OOH +O2       = OOC10H20OOH                 2.000E+11  0.00      0.0             
OOC10H20OOH         = C10ket  +OH                 8.910E+10  0.00  17000.0
C10ket              =>CH2O    +C5H11CO+OH  +C3H6  1.980E+16  0.00  41000.0
C5H11CO   +O2       =>C3H7    +C2H3   +CO  +HO2   3.160E+13  0.00  10000.0              
C10H21    +O2       = C10H20  +HO2                3.160E+11  0.00   6000.0
C10H20    +O2       =>2C3H6   +C2H5   +CH2O+HCO   3.160E+13  0.00  10000.0             
C10H21              =>2C3H6   +C2H5   +C2H4       4.000E+13  0.00  28810.0            

!MD sub-mechanism

MD        +O2       = MDJ     +HO2                3.000E+14  0.00  43150.0
MD        +OH       = MDJ     +H2O                1.000E+08  1.85     58.5
MD        +H        =>MDJ     +H2                 1.000E+06  2.00   2500.0
MD        +HO2      = MDJ     +H2O2               9.220E+05  2.55  10530.0
MDJ       +O2       = MDJO2                       2.000E+11  0.00      0.0           
MDJO2               = MDOOHJ                      5.510E+13  0.00  19000.0
MDOOHJ    +O2       = O2MDOOH                     2.000E+11  0.00      0.0           
O2MDOOH             = MDket   +OH                 8.910E+10  0.00  17000.0
MDket               =>C6H13CHO+CH2CO  +CH3OCO+OH  1.980E+15  0.00  41000.0
C6H13CHO  +O2       =>C3H7    +C3H6   +CO   +HO2  3.160E+13  0.00  10000.0
MDJ                 =>C3H7    +2C2H4  +MP2D       8.000E+13  0.00  28810.0
!MD5D sub-mechanism

MD5D      +O2       = MD5DJ   +HO2                6.000E+14  0.00  40150.0  
MD5D      +OH       = MD5DJ   +H2O                1.000E+07  1.85     58.5
MD5D      +H        =>MD5DJ   +H2                 1.000E+06  2.00   2500.0
MD5D      +HO2      = MD5DJ   +H2O2               5.000e+12  0.00   9930.0
MD5DJ     +O2       = MD5DJO2                     2.000E+11  0.00      0.0             
MD5DJO2             = MD5DOOHJ                    5.510E+13  0.00  19000.0   
MD5DOOHJ  +O2       = O2MD5DOOH                   2.000E+11  0.00      0.0             
O2MD5DOOH           = MD5Dket +OH                 8.910E+10  0.00  17000.0   
MD5Dket             =>C6H11CHO+CH3OCO +CH2CO +OH  8.980E+15  0.00  43000.0
C6H11CHO  +O2       =>C3H5    +C3H6   +CO   +HO2  3.160E+13  0.00  10000.0
MD5DJ               =>C3H5    +2C2H4  +MP2D       8.000E+12  0.00  28700.0

